MOSS-LLLite

This project adapts Anima LLLite conditioning to ComfyUI's MOSS-Image model.
It imports AnimaLLLiteConditioning and AnimaLLLiteModule from ComfyUI and adapts
the native MOSS image-generation block for attention-input control.

Upstream project: ComfyUI
https://github.com/Comfy-Org/ComfyUI
Anima LLLite: comfy/ldm/anima/lllite.py
MOSS-Image: comfy/ldm/moss_image/model.py
